    "sentence_translations": [
      "Today Is My Birthday",
      "",
      "At 7:35 am, it was raining.",
      "",
      "Mom and Dad were eating breakfast. Mom was a little unhappy.",
      "She said, “I don’t want to go to school, I want to have fun with you at home.”",
      "",
      "Dad gave Mom a glass of water and said, “You go to school now and have a good class. I’ll wait for you at home, okay? ”",
      "",
      "“No!” Mom said while drinking water. “You only have three days here, and I want to be with you every day.”",
      "",
      "Dad gave Mom an apple and said with a smile, “You only have class in the morning today, you go to class now.",
      "We have a lot of time to have fun together in the afternoon and evening.”",
      "",
      "“Today is my birthday, I don’t have to go to school!” Mom said while eating an apple.",
      "",
      "“In that case, I will go to school with you. I’ll wait until your class starts, and then I’ll go back. Okay?” said Dad.",
      "",
      "“Okay!” said Mom. “Then let’s go!”"
    ]
